    "rich_text_KckTAy": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_i3qdf3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This hands-on approach is key to understanding why NADCO is able to offer such tailored solutions. The company has even developed unique products, such as a scented label, and has sent a product to Mars, underscoring its capability to think outside the box and create innovative solutions. Neil’s focus is not just on providing a product, but on delivering a service—ensuring that clients recognize NADCO’s value as a trusted partner who supports their creative and business needs at every step of the process.</p><p>In essence, what sets NADCO apart is not only its technical expertise in both printing and die cutting, but Neil’s hands-on leadership, dedication to innovation, and commitment to offering a truly personalized, service-oriented approach to every client.</p><p>In 2023, Neil’s son joined the company, marking an exciting new chapter in the family business. This addition helps ensure that the legacy of excellence and innovation continues as the next generation brings new ideas and energy to the company.</p><p>Outside of work, Neil is an avid traveler, with a special love for Aruba, where he enjoys relaxing and exploring the island’s beauty. When he’s not traveling, he enjoys spending quality time with his family, creating memories that strengthen the bond between them. Neil is also a passionate golfer and fisherman, activities that allow him to unwind and enjoy the outdoors. This blend of professional dedication and personal enjoyment of life helps to shape the well-rounded approach he brings to both his business and personal endeavors.</p><p>In summary, Neil Doniger’s leadership, innovative mindset, and commitment to service have been key to NADCO’s longevity and success. His love of family, travel, and outdoor activities adds depth to his life, balancing his professional drive with personal passions.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
